Arbitrum Compound V3 Fork ClaimRewards

GIVEN the Arbitrum parent Compound v3 adapter
  WHEN a caller without REWARDS_OPERATOR_ROLE on the vault calls claimRewards
    THEN it reverts
  WHEN a caller with REWARDS_OPERATOR_ROLE on the vault calls claimRewards
    THEN it emits RewardsClaimed and sends reward tokens held by the adapter to the recipient
